@startuml
title Storyteller Story Session Flow

start
:Receive user story input;

if (turn-based mode enabled?) then (yes)
  :Evaluate trigger, actor scope,
  round participation and penalties;
endif

:Load canonical state and summaries;
:Load recent complete turns;
:Automatically refresh graph snapshot;
:Resolve relevant ACTIVE hard facts;
:Assemble story prompt;
:Send chat request through resilience guard;
:Receive draft response;

if (validation enabled?) then (yes)
  :Resolve graph facts from input and draft;
  :Build validation request with rules,
  fixed protagonists and graph facts;
  :Send request through validation guard;
  if (ALLOW?) then (yes)
    :Use sanitized draft;
  else (REPLACE)
    :Use sanitized replacement;
  endif
else (no)
  :Use draft response;
endif

:Append completed turn to history;
:Persist active turn-state;
if (cache-buster interval reached?) then (yes)
  :Send silent reset-with-cache-buster request;
endif
:Print final response;
:Queue canonical state, recent summary,
and long-term summary updates;
stop
@enduml
